  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Psi Blade Sweep",
  "display_fullname": "Brute Melee Psionic Melee Psi Blade Sweep",
  "display_help": "You project a Psi Blade and swing it in a broad arc hitting all foes within a wide cone in front of you for high Psionic and Lethal damage. Foes struck by this power have their recharge reduced and have chance to become disoriented for a short time. Psi Blade Sweep has a high chance of granting you Insight. While you have Insight, Psi Blade Sweep will deal additional minor psionic damage over time and has a greater chance to disorient foes.",
